'''UppsaLAN #2''' is a [[2025]] private LAN event organized by {{Player|Peppe|flag=se}} and {{Player|Javve|flag=se}} in Uppsala, Sweden.
This event is bigger than its predecessor [[UppsaLAN]] and features 16 seats. Streamed from onsite by [https://twitch.tv/peppe_qw Peppe]. 

== Format ==
* 4on4: Round-Robin Group Stage
* Single-Elimination Playoffs
* All games {{Abbr/Bo3}} with a TB3+Schloss map pool.

